Description: CUPS driver for Canon LBP6000/LBP6018 laser printers
 A free CUPS filter and backend for Canon laser printers that only speak the
 proprietary CAPT protocol (version 3, with Hi-SCoA compression), such as the
 LBP6000 and LBP6018.
 .
 The package installs the PPD, the raster filter, the USB backend, and the
 diagnostic tools captstat, captdump and captwire.
